    "chunk_text": "In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti.Ceolred abbot & \u00f0a higan on Medeshamstede sella\u00f0 Wulfrede End for\u00f0on we him \u00f0is land sella\u00f0 \u00f0et he \u00f0es landes fulne friodom bigete in ece \u00e6rfeweardnisse \u00e6t & bruce \u00feere cirican lafard on Medeshamstede \u00f0es landes \u00e6t Slioforda & Wulfred \u00f0es on Sempingaham. & he geselle eghwelce gere to Medeshamstede tua tunnan fulle luhtres aloh & tua slegneat & s\u00ebx hund & hi sion symle in allum here life eadmode & hearsume & under\u00feeodde. & ofer here tuega d\u00ebg \u00feonne agefe hio \u00feet land into \u00feere cirican to Medeshamstede mid freodome. & we him \u00feis sella\u00f0 mid felda & mid wuda & mid fenne sua \u00feerto belimpe\u00f0. Si\u00f0 heora tuuege d\u00e6g agan sie \u00feonne agefe mon tuuenti hida higuum to biodland & \u00feere cirican & he wes feormied tuuege hida landes \u00e6t L\u00ebhcotum his erfeweorda sweolcum swelce him \u00f0onne Anno uero dominice incarnationis (25) DCCCLII Indictione XV hoc factum est.Her sindan \u00f0a naman Ic Ceolred abbod \u00feas ure selene mid Cristes rode tacne trymme & festnie..",
